id: rail_util_built_in_phys
label: RAIL Utility, Built-in PHYs Across HFXO Frequencies (RAIL 2.x)
description: >
  Utility to include built-in (Standards based) PHYs. On EFR32XG24, EFR32XG26
  and SixG301 parts, 38.4 MHz, 39 MHz, and 40 Mhz HFXO support is provided by
  this component.
package: rail_library
category: Platform|Radio|RAIL 2.x
quality: deprecated
